publish: allow — synthetic OIDC test keypair, generated for this repository and
used only by cosmon-oidc-testkit to sign and verify test tokens. It authorises
nothing: no service, no account, no environment ever trusted the matching public
key. It is tracked on purpose, because a testkit whose keypair is generated at
run time cannot ship a fixed, reviewable set of test vectors.

The waiver is a sidecar rather than an inline marker because PEM has no comment
syntax — see `scripts/publish.sh`, `credential_waived_by_sidecar`.

If this key is ever pointed at anything real, delete this file first: the gate
is then supposed to red.

